Using the formula \( S_n = a \cdot \frac{1 - r^n}{1 - r} \) for \( n = 5 \),  
\[
S_5 = \frac{1}{3} \cdot \frac{1 - (1/3)^5}{1 - 1/3} 
= \frac{1}{3} \cdot \frac{1 - 1/243}{2/3} 
= \frac{1}{3} \cdot \frac{242/243}{2/3} 
